    title: "Bomb Jack",
    description: Some("Jack jumps high and floats through the air, clearing each screen of its twenty-four bombs while birds and mummies chase him — once they reach the bottom they become saucers and orbs that cost a life on contact. Collecting bombs in sequence lights the next and fills a bonus meter, releasing a bouncing \'P\' that turns enemies into coins."),
